{"key": "e78c169647cf89b3596ff46164a70ccb", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The main differences in the passages are price and features.\n\n- **Price:** Get Clássica is R$ 79,90/month and Get Smart is R$ 129,90/month [4].\n- **Get Smart:** It's a smart card machine that runs on Android. You can manage stock, take orders, close tabs, load a menu and issue fiscal receipts directly on the device [2][5]. It also lets you integrate the terminal with your business system [2]. Because of this, you may not need a separate computer or fiscal printer [1].\n- **Get Clássica:** The passages don't describe its features, so I can't compare it with the Smart beyond price.\n\nMISSING: Get Clássica features and specs (the passages cover only its price)", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUkHrrHeEyLKx1qqZEU", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4890, "output_tokens": 231, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-02#0"}
