{"key": "5dafb869c89d1992d15561ecc8ba7c61", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Smart costs more and does more than the Get Clássica. Get Clássica is R$ 79,90/month and Get Smart is R$ 129,90/month [prod-ofertas-maquininha-11].\n\n- **Get Smart:** It's a smart card machine that runs on Android. You can manage stock, take orders, close tabs, load a menu and issue fiscal receipts on the device itself [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10][sup-duvidas-get-smart-17]. You can also integrate it with your business system [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10]. So you may not need a separate computer or fiscal printer [sup-duvidas-get-smart-08].\n- **Get Clássica:** The sources I found only give its price, not its features. I can't compare the two beyond price.\n\nI can hand you to a human agent if you want the full Clássica specs.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUkWsgugszDYrs2MN2N", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3557, "output_tokens": 284, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-hard-02#0"}
{"key": "9c69ebe001c39f035238de735e374092", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "O terminal T1988B (Get Clássica, chip) está offline há 5 horas e sem sinal. O último contato dele foi em 03/11/2026 às 23:17. O T1988A (Get Smart, Wi-Fi) aparece online, com sinal bom. O último contato dele foi em 04/11/2026 às 04:17.\n\nSe a que não liga é a T1988B, posso propor a abertura de um chamado técnico por \"sem_sinal\" ([policy:capabilities]). Ele só é aberto depois que você confirmar, e a proposta expira em 15 minutos. Quer que eu proponha?\n\nSe for a T1988A, me diga o que está acontecendo com ela.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUkXzQn3CAPT8249Zvs", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3447, "output_tokens": 233, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-hard-01#0"}
