{"key": "2c4d14f16dd2715fb58697761234d275", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "To sign up for Pix at Getnet, you enter a Pix key tied to the receiving account where you want to be paid (the \"domicílio bancário\") [sup-duvidas-82][sup-duvidas-81]. You only need one key. If the account has several keys registered, pick one. You can sign up in the Portal Minha Conta or the Getnet app [sup-duvidas-82].\n\nThe sources don't say outright whether a bank account is mandatory. They also don't say whether a Get Conta account can be the receiving account. I can pass your question to a human agent if you'd like.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUm9x8n26dMivJdesPo", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3499, "output_tokens": 186, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-hard-05#0"}
